# Components Directory

This directory contains reusable UI components for the LNK File Management Center.

## Structure

- `TitleBar/` - Custom window title bar with minimize/maximize/close buttons
- `Sidebar/` - Navigation sidebar
- `Toolbar/` - Action toolbar components
- `FileList/` - File listing and grid components
- `FileDetail/` - File detail panel components
- `Modals/` - Modal dialogs
- `Buttons/` - Custom button components

## Usage

Components should be organized by feature, not by type.